e, we can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }f(r(t))\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387492 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387492 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387492 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387495 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387492 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387496 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387492 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186387497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387492 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387492 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387492 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186387495 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387492 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "1af7ee7b-5d10-5025-8624-92a4d018ecb7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387493 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387493 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387493 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2cc88e3d-a852-5587-8a01-ed034f9f4385" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387494 #edb/ref 1080 "4{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }{sin}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387494 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387494 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0354e92a-880d-5b37-9463-ad3a8ea451ae" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387495 #edb/ref 1080 "2{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{cos}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387495 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186387495 #edb/re